                 ---- raking_adjustment_pkg ----------------------------------

                 ⚠ SCOPE, narrower than upstream. Unit weights; no
                 non-proratable amounts (SumNoProratableValues = 0, so k =
                 (T - S)/S — which also keeps k >= -1, the regime in which the
                 BASIC approach cannot flip a sign; the sign-flip regime that
                 EI_RakingScaling exists for is outside this core); amounts
                 non-negative and at least one (upstream marks a zero amount as
                 not proratable, line 511); a single edit; the finer whole unit
                 (one decimal beyond the reported precision), so the scaled
                 value is V*T/S in exact integer arithmetic and "halves away
                 from zero" for non-negative values is (2*V*T + S) / (2*S). The
                 ratio-bounds check (lines 588-604), the guard that the target
                 lands on the reported precision (UTIL_Decimal, lines 543-547 —
                 in fine units, T a multiple of 10) and the flag bookkeeping
                 are NOT modelled. Amounts 1..100, targets 0..1000, at most 8
                 components, so every product in a contract stays in range.
                 The recursion index N and the subtypes of V, T and S are
                 load-bearing for the range checks; nothing here says what
                 upstream does outside those ranges.

                 ⚠ WHAT THE DIFFERENTIAL TEST FOUND — a tie-rounding gap between
                 the exact rule and the implementation, stated here as scope.
                 The core is UTIL_Round's rule ("halves away from zero")
                 applied to the exact quotient V*T/S. Upstream applies the same
                 rule to v + v*k computed in doubles, k = (T - S)/S. Over every
                 V in 1..40, T in 0..120, S in 1..40 (193,600 inputs, 9,509 of
                 them exact ties) a verbatim harness of upstream's step, in
                 real units, disagrees with the core on 1,897 inputs at zero
                 decimal places (2,143 at one, 1,988 at two) — every one an
                 exact tie, and at every one upstream is lower by one fine
                 unit, because when k is not exactly representable the value
                 lands a hair under the half. Restricted to targets on the
                 reported precision, which is what upstream accepts: 190 of 857
                 ties at zero places. No claim that any statistic was affected,
                 that this is a defect, or that a documented tie rule exists
                 that upstream departs from — none was found. The carry step
                 that follows equals the fine total exactly only when that
                 total lands on the reported precision (Balance_Is_Preserved's
                 precondition); a tie shifted by one fine unit changes the fine
                 total by one, so the reported group total can differ by one
                 reported unit between the exact rule and upstream, and which
                 component absorbs it can differ. See the finding of 2026-09-09
                 in our records; its first version (115 disagreements) came
                 from a harness in the wrong units and was corrected the same
                 morning.

                 WHAT IS PROVED, graded by the vacuity battery. Two theorems
                 carry the content: Adjusted is the nearest fine unit to V*T/S,
                 halves up (a division characterisation, both bounds); and
                 Adjusted_Sum keeps the adjusted amounts together within half a
                 unit per component of T times the total, inductively on the
                 recursion (its other conjunct, the bound 100000 * N, is the
                 accumulation bound the recursion needs and restates a subtype).
                 The three predicates are COROLLARIES of those two contracts —
                 each still proves with the bodies of the functions it names
                 hidden — and are graded so, not as theorems: Lands_Within_Half_Each
                 (with the amounts' own total as divisor the group lands within
                 N/2 of the target, the slack the carry step is built to close),
                 Order_Preserved (scaling never reverses two amounts), and
                 Exact_When_Divisible (when S divides V*T rounding changes
                 nothing). They are stated for the reader, and they say what
                 the two theorems already imply. Total_Of is a bounded
                 definition.

